| Add Script node | `uip maestro flow node add DiceRoller.flow core.action.script --label "Roll the Die" --input '{...}'` |
| Add End node | `uip maestro flow node add DiceRoller.flow core.control.end --label "Done"` |
| Wire start → script | `uip maestro flow edge add DiceRoller.flow start rollTheDie1 --source-port output --target-port input` |
| Wire script → end | `uip maestro flow edge add DiceRoller.flow rollTheDie1 done1 --source-port success --target-port input` |
| Validate | `uip maestro flow validate DiceRoller.flow` |
| Format | `uip maestro flow format DiceRoller.flow` |

